libmanette drives gamepads through evdev, which this system provides with
the same event codes and ioctl encoding (see the libmanette port patch).
WebKit enables that path only for OS(LINUX); take it on OS(LIKEOS) too,
as every distribution build does, instead of compiling the generic stub.

